[
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:0.2", "PA_ja_507:0.3"], "en": "The Collection of Twenty, Chapter on Mātaṅga.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:0.4"], "en": "11. The Mahāpalobhana Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:1.1", "PA_ja_507:1.2"], "en": "Having descended from the Brahma-world, a son of the gods possessed of great psychic power;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:1.3"], "en": "A son was born to the king,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:1.4"], "en": "amidst the fulfillment of all his desires.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:2.1"], "en": "Whether it be sensual pleasures or the perception of sensual pleasure—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:2.2"], "en": "It is not found even in the Brahma-world;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:2.3"], "en": "therefore, through that very perception,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:2.4"], "en": "you should feel revulsion for sensual pleasures.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:3.1", "PA_ja_507:3.2"], "en": "For him, a meditation hall was beautifully constructed within the inner palace;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:3.3"], "en": "there he dwelt in seclusion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:3.4"], "en": "Meditate alone in seclusion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:4.1", "PA_ja_507:4.2"], "en": "That king, tormented by grief for his son, lamented.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:4.3"], "en": "“This is my only son,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:4.4"], "en": "and he does not enjoy sensual pleasures.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:5.1"], "en": "What indeed could be the means here?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:5.2", "PA_ja_507:5.3"], "en": "Who indeed knows anything that could tempt my son,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:5.4"], "en": "so that he might long for sensual pleasures?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:6.1"], "en": "Then a maiden appeared right there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:6.2"], "en": "endowed with beauty and form,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:6.3"], "en": "skilled in dance and song.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:6.4"], "en": "And when it was played, she circumambulated it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:7.1", "PA_ja_507:7.2"], "en": "Having approached the king there, she spoke to him thus:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:7.3"], "en": "“I shall indeed entice him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:7.4"], "en": "if he will become my husband.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:8.1"], "en": "To her who spoke thus, the king—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:8.2"], "en": "He said this to the young girl:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:8.3"], "en": "\"You yourself must entice him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:8.4"], "en": "he shall become your husband.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:9.1"], "en": "And she, having gone to the inner apartments,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:9.2"], "en": "spoke much that was connected with sensual desire—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:9.3"], "en": "words that reached the heart and were full of affection.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:9.4"], "en": "She spoke these wonderful verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:10.1"], "en": "And as that woman was singing,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:10.2"], "en": "having heard her voice—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:10.3", "PA_ja_507:10.4"], "en": "Desire for sensual pleasure arose within him, and he questioned the people:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:11.1"], "en": "\"Whose is this sound? Who is it?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:11.2"], "en": "He speaks much, both high and low;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:11.3"], "en": "it is heart-stirring, lovely,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:11.4"], "en": "and oh, so pleasant to my ears!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:12.1"], "en": "“This, O King, is indeed negligence;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:12.2"], "en": "this is play that is not limited.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:12.3"], "en": "If you were to enjoy sensual pleasures, [you would be lost].”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:12.4"], "en": "“May they honor him more and more.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:13.1"], "en": "“Come now, let us go by this path;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:13.2"], "en": "let him sing not far away.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:13.3", "PA_ja_507:13.4"], "en": "“Let her sing in the presence of Assama, close to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:14.1"], "en": "Having sung through the wall, she sang:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:14.2"], "en": "He entered the meditation chamber;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:14.3"], "en": "they bound him in succession,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:14.4"], "en": "like a forest elephant.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:15.1"], "en": "Having understood his craving for sensual pleasure,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:15.2"], "en": "the nature of envy arose in him:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:15.3"], "en": "\"I alone shall enjoy these sensual pleasures.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:15.4"], "en": "\"May no other man exist.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:16.1"], "en": "Then, having seized his sword,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:16.2"], "en": "he set out to kill the men.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:16.3"], "en": "“I alone shall eat;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:16.4"], "en": "let there be no other man.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:17.1"], "en": "Then all the people of the countryside—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:17.2"], "en": "Having assembled, they cried out:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:17.3", "PA_ja_507:17.4"], "en": "\"O Great King, this son of yours is harming innocent people.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:18.1"], "en": "The king married her,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:18.2"], "en": "and the kshatriya [banished] her from the kingdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:18.3"], "en": "saying: \"As far as my conquest extends,\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:18.4"], "en": "\"You must not stay here for long.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:19.1"], "en": "Then, taking his wife with him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:19.2"], "en": "he approached the ocean.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:19.3"], "en": "Having built a leaf-hut,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:19.4"], "en": "he entered the forest for alms-gathering.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:20.1"], "en": "Then, at that time, a seer arrived there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:20.2"], "en": "One after another across the ocean,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:20.3", "PA_ja_507:20.4"], "en": "he reached his house when the time for the meal had arrived.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:21.1"], "en": "But his wife seduced him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:21.2"], "en": "see how truly dreadful it was!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:21.3"], "en": "He fell away from the holy life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:21.4"], "en": "You have fallen away from your supernormal powers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:22.1"], "en": "And the prince, from his gleaning,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:22.2"], "en": "has gathered much forest root and fruit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:22.3"], "en": "Taking his burden in the evening,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:22.4"], "en": "he approached the hermitage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:23.1"], "en": "and the seer, seeing the khattiya, [welcomed him].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:23.2"], "en": "He approached the ocean,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:23.3", "PA_ja_507:23.4"], "en": "thinking, \"I shall travel through the air,\" yet he sank down in the great deep.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:24.1", "PA_ja_507:24.2"], "en": "And the kshatriya, seeing the seer sinking in the great ocean,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:24.3"], "en": "out of compassion for him alone—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:24.4"], "en": "He spoke these verses:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:25.1", "PA_ja_507:25.2"], "en": "“Having come of my own accord by means of psychic power to a place where the waters were not overflowing, [I stood] in the midst of the flood.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:25.3"], "en": "Having approached a woman who has cultivated the female nature,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:25.4"], "en": "you sink into the great ocean.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:26.1"], "en": "Mahāmāyā is a whirlpool.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:26.2", "PA_ja_507:26.3"], "en": "It is a corruption of the holy life; knowing this,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:26.4"], "en": "one should avoid it from afar.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:27.1"], "en": "Insatiable, soft-spoken,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:27.2"], "en": "and like rivers that are difficult to fill—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:27.3"], "en": "those who know her for what she is sink down.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:27.4"], "en": "One should avoid them from afar.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:28.1"], "en": "Whatever these women pursue,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:28.2"], "en": "whether through passion or through wealth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:28.3", "PA_ja_507:28.4"], "en": "“Like fire, they quickly burn him down at his very station.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:29.1"], "en": "Having heard the words of the khattiya, [the king said:]", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:29.2"], "en": "Disgust arose in Isisi;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:29.3"], "en": "having regained the ancient path,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:29.4"], "en": "he went through the air.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:30.1", "PA_ja_507:30.2"], "en": "And the wise khattiya, seeing the seer traveling through the air,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:30.3"], "en": "was moved by a sense of spiritual urgency.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:30.4"], "en": "He truly delighted in going forth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:31.1"], "en": "Then, having gone forth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:31.2"], "en": "he caused the passion for sensual pleasures to fade away.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:31.3"], "en": "\"Having abandoned sensual lust,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:31.4"], "en": "he went to the Brahma-world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_507:32.1"], "en": "Thus ends the eleventh Jātaka, the Mahāpalobhana Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
